---
// ponytail: English-only for now; localize via [...lang] once the catalogues carry the copy.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import AdSlot from '../components/AdSlot.astro';
import Badge from '../components/ui/Badge.astro';
import apis from '../../../data/image_apis.json';
import { CARD_VARIANT } from '../lib/format';
import { IMAGE_LAST_VERIFIED } from '../lib/seo.mjs';

const CARD_LABEL = { no: 'No card', registration: 'Email only', phone: 'Phone', yes: 'Card / paid' };
const free = apis.filter(a => a.free_type !== 'none');
const notFree = apis.filter(a => a.free_type === 'none');
const pageUrl = 'https://www.freellm.site/free-image-generation-apis/';
const title = `${free.length} Free Image Generation APIs (Verified ${IMAGE_LAST_VERIFIED.slice(0, 7)})`;
const description = `Free text-to-image APIs that still work: Cloudflare Workers AI, Zhipu CogView-3-Flash, NVIDIA NIM, Pollinations and more. Free limits, endpoints, models and code, checked ${IMAGE_LAST_VERIFIED}.`;

const schema = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@graph': [
    {
      '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
      itemListElement: [
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Home', item: 'https://www.freellm.site/' },
        { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Free Image Generation APIs', item: pageUrl },
      ],
    },
    {
      '@type': 'ItemList',
      name: 'Free image generation APIs',
      url: pageUrl,
      numberOfItems: free.length,
      itemListElement: free.map((a, i) => ({
        '@type': 'ListItem',
        position: i + 1,
        item: {
          '@type': 'SoftwareApplication',
          name: a.name,
          applicationCategory: 'DeveloperApplication',
          operatingSystem: 'Any',
          url: a.signup_url,
          offers: { '@type': 'Offer', price: '0', priceCurrency: 'USD', description: a.free_allowance },
        },
      })),
    },
    {
      '@type': 'Dataset',
      name: 'Free image generation APIs',
      description,
      url: pageUrl,
      dateModified: IMAGE_LAST_VERIFIED,
      isAccessibleForFree: true,
      license: 'https://github.com/khushaljethava/freellm-apis/blob/main/LICENSE',
      distribution: {
        '@type': 'DataDownload',
        encodingFormat: 'application/json',
        contentUrl: 'https://github.com/khushaljethava/freellm-apis/blob/main/data/image_apis.json',
      },
      creator: { '@type': 'Organization', name: 'freellm.site', url: 'https://www.freellm.site/' },
    },
  ],
};

const openaiSample = `from openai import OpenAI

# Any OpenAI-compatible entry below: swap base_url, key and model.
client = OpenAI(base_url="https://open.bigmodel.cn/api/paas/v4", api_key="YOUR_ZHIPU_KEY")

img = client.images.generate(model="cogview-3-flash", prompt="a red fox in fresh snow, golden hour", size="1024x1024")
print(img.data[0].url)  # temporary URL: download it`;

const cloudflareSample = `curl https://api.cloudflare.com/client/v4/accounts/$ACCOUNT_ID/ai/run/@cf/black-forest-labs/flux-1-schnell \\
  -H "Authorization: Bearer $CF_API_TOKEN" \\
  -d '{"prompt": "a red fox in fresh snow, golden hour", "steps": 4}'
# -> {"result": {"image": "<base64 JPEG>"}}`;
---
<Base title={title} description={description} schema={schema}>
  <nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="mb-6 text-sm text-muted-foreground">
    <ol class="flex items-center gap-1.5">
      <li><a class="text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground" href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-hidden="true">/</li>
      <li aria-current="page" class="text-foreground">Free Image Generation APIs</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-4xl">Free Image Generation APIs</h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg text-muted-foreground">
    {free.length} text-to-image APIs you can call for free today, with the limits that actually apply ·
    <time datetime={IMAGE_LAST_VERIFIED}>verified {IMAGE_LAST_VERIFIED}</time>
  </p>

  <div class="prose mt-6 max-w-3xl dark:prose-invert prose-a:text-primary">
    <p>
      <strong>Short answer:</strong> the only recurring, no-card image API with a published daily quota is
      <strong>Cloudflare Workers AI</strong>: 10,000 neurons a day, which is roughly 230 FLUX.1 schnell images at 512×512.
      <strong>Zhipu's CogView-3-Flash</strong> is free outright but runs in China. Everything else is either a one-time signup
      credit or a free balance whose size the provider doesn't publish. Several APIs that older guides call free (Gemini's Nano Banana,
      Together's FLUX schnell, Hugging Face) <a href="#no-longer-free">no longer are</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <AdSlot variant="top" />

  <h2 class="section-title">Comparison</h2>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">Free allowance</th><th scope="col">Sign-up</th><th scope="col">Recurring?</th><th scope="col">OpenAI-compatible</th><th scope="col">Get key</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {free.map(a => (
          <tr>
            <td><a href={`#${a.id}`} class="font-medium">{a.name}</a></td>
            <td>{a.free_allowance}</td>
            <td><Badge variant={CARD_VARIANT[a.credit_card_required]}>{CARD_LABEL[a.credit_card_required]}</Badge></td>
            <td>{a.free_type === 'permanent' ? 'Yes' : 'One-time / unpublished'}</td>
            <td>{a.openai_compatible ? 'Yes' : 'No'}</td>
            <td><a href={a.signup_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get key →</a></td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  {free.map(a => (
    <section id={a.id} class="scroll-mt-20">
      <h2 class="section-title">{a.name}</h2>
      <dl class="grid gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm sm:grid-cols-[10rem_1fr]">
        <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Free allowance</dt><dd>{a.free_allowance}</dd>
        <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Endpoint</dt><dd><code class="font-mono text-xs break-all">{a.endpoint}</code></dd>
        <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Models</dt>
        <dd class="flex flex-wrap gap-1">{a.models.map(m => <Badge variant="outline"><code class="font-mono">{m}</code></Badge>)}</dd>
        <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Notes</dt><dd>{a.notes}</dd>
        <dt class="text-muted-foreground">Source</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href={a.source_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Official docs</a>
          {a.provider_id && <> · <a href={`/providers/${a.provider_id}/`}>{a.name.split(' (')[0]} LLM free tier</a></>}
        </dd>
      </dl>
    </section>
  ))}

  <h2 class="section-title">Code: OpenAI-compatible providers</h2>
  <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">Zhipu, SiliconFlow, ModelScope and Pollinations accept the standard <code>/v1/images/generations</code> request, so the OpenAI SDK works. ModelScope additionally needs async mode and task polling.</p>
  <pre class="mb-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border bg-muted/40 p-4 text-xs"><code>{openaiSample}</code></pre>

  <h2 class="section-title">Code: Cloudflare Workers AI</h2>
  <pre class="mb-8 overflow-x-auto rounded-lg border bg-muted/40 p-4 text-xs"><code>{cloudflareSample}</code></pre>

  <h2 id="no-longer-free" class="section-title scroll-mt-20">No longer free</h2>
  <p class="mb-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground">These still show up in "free image API" lists, but the official pricing says otherwise.</p>
  <div class="table-wrap">
    <table>
      <thead><tr><th scope="col">Provider</th><th scope="col">Status</th><th scope="col">What changed</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        {notFree.map(a => (
          <tr>
            <td class="font-medium">{a.name}</td>
            <td>{a.free_allowance}</td>
            <td>{a.notes} <a href={a.source_url} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source</a></td>
          </tr>
        ))}
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="prose max-w-3xl dark:prose-invert prose-a:text-primary">
    <h2>How we verify</h2>
    <p>
      Every allowance above comes from the provider's own pricing or docs page, linked in each entry. Free tiers for image
      models change faster than for text models, so treat the date at the top as the freshness of this page. Spotted a change?
      <a href="https://github.com/khushaljethava/freellm-apis/blob/main/data/image_apis.json" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Edit image_apis.json on GitHub</a>.
      Looking for text models instead? See the <a href="/">free LLM API directory</a>.
    </p>
  </div>

  <AdSlot variant="bottom" />
</Base>
